  "description": "# ⚔️ DREAM WARRIORS\n### Part of the DREAM ALLIANCE ✨ \nGuilds for every level for smooth and fast progression 📈\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n        \n      \n⚠️ READ BIO BEFORE APPLYING OR BE REJECTED ❌\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### REQUIREMENTS 📋\n- Combat level 80+ ⚔️\n- Stockpile 5,000g daily 💰\n- Kicked after 4 days inactive 📉\n- Discord required 💬\n\n### RAID TIMES ⏰\n- Early: 12PM CET ☀️ (1000 UTC)\n- Late: 8PM CET 🌙   (1800 UTC)\n\n### BENEFITS 🎁\n- Twice daily raids ⚔️\n- Giveaways &amp; guides 📚\n- World Boss &amp; Shooting Star pings 🔔\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### RECRUITMENT OPEN ✅ when slots available\n #### discord.gg/h4NhRWmDsp 🔗",
